  "limitations": [
    "The bootloader boot decision and firmware loader execute in an emulator over authored state with the file-system leaves, the signature verifier 0x80c0e2b6 and the image handoff 0x80c0084a supplied; the indirect jump into the loaded image is a harness stop and is not taken.",
